window.products.push({"id":1099045,"name":"OUR MOMENTS Couples: 100 Conversation Starters for Great Relationships - Fun Conversation Cards Game for Couples","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ml0szRgTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Paper 💗 Quality time - for you and your partner - Enjoy date night in a completely new way. This game for couples is a sure fire way to get the sparks flying between you two! It will get you out of your comfort zone and remind you why you are together in the first place. 💗 Couples who make time for each other, stay together - It’s important that your relationship is both mental and emotional and one definitely leads to the other. Nothing could be more beautiful than showing your partner you care and you can do that just by asking a question and listening to the answer. 💗 Learn about each other - Whether it’s a first date or you’ve been together for years. Interact with your partner and get to know each other. Games add joy to life and relieve stress and we could all do with some of that. 💗 Focus on each other - Sharing laughter and fun can foster empathy, compassion, trust, and rapport with others. Put aside the day-to-day thoughts and worries and focus only on the game and your partner. Not all the cards are related to romantic topics and this is certainly a game for any couple. It’s our way of taking back our lives from the stress of work, family, friends and general day to day events. This is YOUR TIME enjoy it together! 💗 Quality because you'll want to keep using them - 100 question cards printed on 300gsm card stock which come shrink wrapped in a custom tuck box. This game makes a great gift whether it's for you and your partner or for friends. BUY IT NOW! There is no risk. If you are unhappy just return within 30 days for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Ml0szRgTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OUR MOMENTS","source_asin":"B08G8G4TSX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G8G4TSX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G8G4TSX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1099046,"name":"kleeklea Stovetop Espresso Maker, Premium Aluminum Moka Pot 3 Espresso Cups, Percolator Coffee Pot, Cuban Coffee Maker Italian Coffee Maker Greca Coff","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bcXzBCThL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Makes Great Tasting Coffee】It's not hard to be your own barista, you can make delicious lattes and cappuccinos at home with kleeklea Moka pot.Classic Italian moka pot notorious for making the best traditional espresso quick & easy. Durable cast aluminum body with pressure valve for higher caffeine extraction and flavor. Depending on bean variety and grind selection, this espresso maker can create foam emulsion or crema. 【Durable and Innovative Design】The flip-top lid features a temperature resistant and the transparent lid allows you to observe the coffee coming out of the Moka pot when you are making coffee.Carefully crafted with strong cast aluminum for long-lasting durability.Provides thorough and even heat distribution for enhanced flavor and aroma. 【Easy to Use】kleeklea Moka pot can work on gas and electric stove top and propane camping stoves as well. Simply fill the lower chamber with water, add ground coffee to the filter, then place on stovetop. Within minutes, delicious, bubbling cups of espresso will fill your pot. 【Easy to Clean】Simply rinse with clean water and put all the components air-dry in upright position before reassembling. Soap is not recommended as it removes essential coffee oils that build up in the pot and give the coffee brew its unique aroma and flavor. 【Easy to Carry】This manual coffee machine is perfect when on the go. It is made of high-quality and lightweight materials and can be easily stuffed inside your bag or luggage without breaking or bending. Ideal to bring along with you when traveling or camping so you can enjoy your nice coffee time wherever you go and whenever you want.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bcXzBCThL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"kleeklea","source_asin":"B0B5TKQ9JZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5TKQ9JZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5TKQ9JZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
