window.products.push({"id":1099163,"name":"Pinelive Rustic Recipe Box with Cards and Divider and Phone Holder! Lockable Recipe Organizer Box with 100 Index Recipe Cards 4x6 Double Sided and 16 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81czzRYrTDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FIRST OF IT’S KIND! While everyone else fumbles around the kitchen with their phone holder, recipe holder and recipe boxes (and, in a sticky mess), you’ll be gliding around yours like culinary goddess! Because this wood recipe box ALSO holds your smartphone AND recipes! Imagine the space you’ll save on your countertop while effortlessly having everything you need at a glance – and free from spills! RECIPE CARDS AND BOX GIFT SET: Not only is the PhoneSlot Recipe Keeper the most practical you’ve seen, it’s giftable too. It comes with 100x double-sided recipe cards, 16x Recipe Card Dividers with tabs and 1x cute conversion card for “good measure”. It’s a unique idea for bridal shower keepsakes. The dividers feature blank tabs so you get to create the categories that work best for you. SOLID PINE AND LOCKABLE: This farmhouse recipe box is crafted from strong pine wood and available in 3 colors (espresso, rustic, or white). And what you’ll also love is that you can fill it with family recipes as a Christmas gift because it comes with lock and keys, so no one will steal your secrets! THE PERFECT SIZE: Strangely, some recipe storage boxes are too small for divider cards with tabs. But this index card box is 5.6” tall and 6.4” wide (inside) so you can fit 5” tall tab cards plus all standard 4x6 recipe cards, 3x5 recipe cards, and those special family recipes in protectors! The two card slots on top are 1/16” wide for thick cards, and the phone slot is 0.86” wide to hold most phones. CRAFTED FOR LIFE: With phone holder, lock, keys, recipe slots, 100 recipe cards, customizable dividers and measuring card, PLUS durable construction (your box is firmly nailed AND glued for long term sturdiness) and plenty of space this might just be the greatest recipe box since sliced (…homemade) bread. Take it home and try it out and see because it comes with a 30-Day Money Back Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81czzRYrTDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PINELIVE","source_asin":"B0812T9729","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0812T9729","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0812T9729","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
