window.products.push({"id":1099479,"name":"Ecovacs DEEBOT OZMO 920 2in1 Mopping Robotic Vacuum with Laser Navigation, No-Go Zones, Systematic Cleaning, Multi-Floor Mapping, Works with Alexa & A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Qr6If-EVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simultaneous vacuuming and mopping in-1-go: DEEBOT 920 efficiently cleans your home by vacuuming and mopping simultaneously. With a 240ml water tank, its capacity could handle the whole house cleaning. You can switch the water amount by mobile APP according to different needs. The ECOVACS Home APP enables you to adjust the water level of the mopping. Smart laser navigation & multi-floor mapping: Smart Navi 3. 0 enables DEEBOT robot vacuum cleaner to efficiently navigate through your home and map your floorplan to your smartphone using laser technology. So you can select specific areas you don’t want the vacuum to clean, and where you want it to clean. DEEBOT can store up to 2 different maps – perfect for multi-level homes and multiple cleaning spaces. No-Go zones & carpet detection: Virtual boundary for not only vacuum, but also for mopping now. By using the ECOVACS Home App you can create unlimited virtual boundaries, restricting the robot from cleaning certain areas. 2 times suction power up automatically, when the robot reach to carpet. A new generation of carpet detection technology can automatically identify carpets and floors, and actively avoid carpets and mats when mopping the floor. Strong climbing ability & optimized brush design: Combined with improved wheels, DEEBOT OZMO 920 can easily cross obstacles like doorsills up to 0.79 inches. The floating brush 2.0 by using new suspension design, together with long & short design on brush, it can sweep up to 4 mm deep cracks. Continuous Cleaning & Smart Control: A longer battery life supports up to 110 minutes run-time for more cleaning. The robot intelligently continues cleaning task after auto-charging. Alexa & Google Assistant voice commands. ECOVACS Smart App comes with 5 plus advanced features including direct control, scheduling, status updates, cleaning modes, accessories status, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Qr6If-EVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECOVACS","source_asin":"B07TJ2M5XY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TJ2M5XY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TJ2M5XY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
