window.products.push({"id":1099489,"name":"ARJOSPO Reusable Storage Bags (8 Pack) Silicone and Plastic Free Zip-lock for Food, Lunch,Sandwich, Small Kids Snack Size, Travel Baggies and More | B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q7I6s4AYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"LEAK & WATER PROOF - To seal and keep your healthy food in freshness, we have improved the zipper to give it a wider edge and added a non-slip design that makes it easier to open. Save money with reusable storage bags! Including 5 Large ones ( 8.5 x 7.2 inch ) and 3 Small ones (8.5 x 4.7 inch) HIGH-QUALITY MATERIALS - Our reusable storage bags are made of food-grade PEVA material, which is an ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY alternative to the harmful PVC. You can use it to carry and storage food without worry. ARJOSPO reusable storage bags have passed the FDA certificate. EXTRA THICK & DURABLE - Versatile Market Leading Product. Replace/reduce your plastic bag consumption. The 8 packs reusable storage bags are perfect containers for snacks, lunches, vegetables, fruits, foods, babies, cosmetics, jewelry make-ups, stationeries , travel and so on. EASY TO CLEAN - Just Hand Wash them in cold or normal temperature water! We don’t recommend putting them in dishwasher as the dishwasher may cause deformation of the zipper, which affects the sealing and using of the bags. PEVA is anti-freezing, but the maximum temperature it can withstand is 80℃/176℉. SO,DO NOT USE HOT WATER!! WIDELY APPLICATION - Different sizes perfect for snacks and sandwich storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q7I6s4AYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARJOSPO","source_asin":"B07T23K1GS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099489","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T23K1GS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T23K1GS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1099490,"name":"Chefast Splatter Screen Set: 13 Inches Stainless Steel Oil Splash Guard, Grill and Cooking Pan Scrapers, and Silicone Hot Handle Holder - Grease Scree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZyTNQMBoL._AC_SL1481_.jpg","description":"ULTRA-FINE QUALITY: Put an end to annoying and potentially painful oil splash with this heavy duty stainless steel oil splatter guard. The 13 inches size makes it perfect for large pots, cast iron skillets, and frying pans without lids. Plus, the TPR handle gives you an element of convenience and protects your hands from painful burns. YOUR PERFECT SET: This combo kit also includes a silicone hot handle holder and two scrapers – one for cooking pans and one for the grill. The silicone handle holder means you can hang on to your skillet despite the heat, while the scrapers make clean-up a snap. PREMIUM MATERIALS: Our grease splatter cover, pan scrapers, and silicone handle holder are all made from durable materials that will last as long as your skillets do. Plus, each item is dishwasher safe and otherwise a breeze to clean, making this a combo no kitchen should be without. MUCH MORE THAN JUST A SPLATTER GUARD: Thanks to its ergonomic resting feet, you can easily keep the surface clean when placing the splatter screen on your counter-tops. When its extra fine mesh is not keeping your family safe from hot oil splash, this metal splatter guard can also act as a cooling rack, veggie steamer, and even pasta strainer. MONEY BACK GUARANTEE: We back up our unique set with a one-year warranty and a 60-day money-back guarantee. If anything goes wrong, a brand-new product or a full refund is just a few clicks away. Make your kitchen a safer, cleaner place and handle those grill and frying pans with ease; get this handy combo kit today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZyTNQMBoL._AC_SL1481_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefast","source_asin":"B01N0TKZPU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099490","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0TKZPU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0TKZPU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
