window.products.push({"id":1099526,"name":"Aromashine Lavender & Eucalyptus Scented Candle, Wood Wicked Candles with Natural Soy Wax, 8 Oz Gold Jar Aromatherapy Scented Candles for Home, 45 Hou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j3CI5W5nL._AC_SL1291_.jpg","description":"Premium Scents - Lavender is a light aroma, that wisps away with a passing breeze. The top of the candle is a combination of lavender with eucalyptus to create an immediate floral sweetness. To accompany this fleeting scent, there are other hints of fragrances that accentuate the lavender. These accent fragrances are a combination of roots and herbs such as rosemary, sage, pine, and ambergris. These Lavender & Eucalyptus candles can remind you of a pleasant day in a natural field. Natural Soy Wax Candle – We care about the ingredients we use and aim for only premium quality. Our carefully curated soy wax is the core component in each candle. Using higher-quality allows for purer, cleaner fragrances. Our wax is not the only sustainable feature as we pour our candles into reusable containers, perfect as miniature vases or additional housewares. Long-Lasting – Although small, the candle does have a fairly long shelf life. Burned properly, they can last as long as 45 hours. The natural wooden wick and ingredients help to ensure a clean, constant burn that is great for any home or similar space. Great Gift for Him, Her, or Them – This candle is great for family, friends, and any important personality in your life. It works as an accent for any room, a nice décor piece, and an easy option for any holiday. This individual candle comes with its own gift box, making it great for any occasion or if you feel the need to splurge on yourself. Candle Purpose - While we focus on creating the best candles, we recognize there are other footprints that need greater support. We want to help our community grow and succeed and, as such, we have enrolled in a monthly donation that gives back to the next generation. We have done this by enrolling in the ELAC Transforming Lives Campaign, which gives directly to students who struggle with finances and helps them with key areas like housing, transportation, food, and clothing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j3CI5W5nL._AC_SL1291_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aromashine","source_asin":"B08YGXR878","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YGXR878","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YGXR878","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
