window.products.push({"id":1099751,"name":"2-Pack Air Filter Factory Replacement For Bosch 651858 Microwave Oven 12-Layer Grease Filters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816ffinKcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Part Number – 651858 Microwave Grease Filter Replacements For Microwave Oven. 12-Layer Aluminum Grease Filter Replacement. Package Contains 2-Filters For Easy Replacement, Filters Are Packaged In a Durable Chipboard Envelope To Prevent Possible Damage In Transit Quality – Proudly Made In The USA Our Compatible 651858 Grease Mesh Filter Is Made From A High Quality Aluminum, The Filter Contains 12- Layers Of Media For Superior Grease Filtration When Cooking. Application –The Grease Mesh Filter Is Installed Underneath The Microwave Above The Stove Top Facing Downward. Filters Are Recommended To Be Hand Washed Using A Mild Dish Detergent And Warm Water. Allow The Filter To Soak In Hot Water And Dish Detergent For Approximately 1 Hour. Then Using A Light Bristled Brush, Gently Scrub The Filters Surface. Rinse With Water And Allow Time To Dry. Guarantee Filter Fit – This Filter Measures 5” x 7-5/8” x 3/32” With A Pull Tab On The Long Side. Before Ordering It Is Always Best To Measure Your Existing Filter Using A Measuring Tape Or Ruler. Partial List Model Cross References - HMV5051U/01, HMV5052U/01, HMV5052U/02, HMV5053U/01, HMV8051U/01, HMV8052U/01, HMV8052U/02, HMV8053U/01, HMVP052U/01, HMVP052U/02 There Are Many More Models","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816ffinKcBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Air Filter Factory","source_asin":"B07SGYC1K3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099751","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SGYC1K3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SGYC1K3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1099752,"name":"Lunarable, Blue and White, Foldable Mattress, Doodle Rain Clouds, 78.7\" x 47.2\", White Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713vj5XcFhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You can find comfort in our folding futons. 78.7\" x 47.2\" x 5\". Best camping mattress you can own is at the tip of your finger with our foldable beds. Folding mattresses made of foam is a growing trend in the bed market and we are here to bring you the latest trends. On top of being a comfortable resting place, our beds can give you a new focal point in your space. Removable decorative polyester fabrics we use are printed with the best gear and safest and most durable print quality possible. They can change the vibe of any room: dorms, children's room, bedroom or spare/guest room. It does not matter where you put it, it looks gorgeous on loft beds, bunk beds or on your regular bed. Usage of the bed is really handy. Thanks to the product's practical design, you can fold it with ease and put it away when you are not using it. Preparing a guest room has never been this easy. It is hassle-free and way comfier than pull out couches, your guests will love you even more; you can give them an authentic Japanese futon experience. Custom printed products are very popular right now and home decor is mostly about following trends. With our gorgeous prints on our bed covers, we have got you covered. Covers are really easy to use, you can easily remove them,wash them and cover them back. The print quality is the highest quality you can find on the market. If your house has a certain decorative theme you can find a proper addition to it within our thousands of patterns. These products also make great gifts because they are stylish and there are so many pattern options to choose from. The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible but due to differences in computer monitors, there might be slight color differences between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713vj5XcFhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lunarable","source_asin":"B07WMWKNQT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099752","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WMWKNQT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WMWKNQT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
