window.products.push({"id":1099769,"name":"Bormioli Rocco Dessert Plate, Set of 24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":86.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51me9u4G+dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The fine tradition of the Bormioli Rocco Group coincides with the very history of glass: the first glassworks was established in Parma in 1825. The company has always demonstrated a great drive to pioneer innovation: in machinery, materials and design. Over the years it has developed a special talent, that of combining time-honored craftsmanship and the passion of master glassmakers with modern industrial processes. Bormioli Rocco is the leading company in its sector in Italy and a great ambassador of the Made in Italy label on international markets. Respect for tradition, passion for good taste and constant research and innovation are Bormioli Rocco's milestones to create products that meet the needs of the consumers. For Bormioli Rocco the respect for the environment; it's a must so its entire manufacturing process is oriented towards a mission of social and environmental responsibility. This dessert plate is part of the Prometeo collection, unique and precious because it features sinuous lines and a sophisticated material texture. Made in tempered opal glass, the Prometeo dessert plate features, like the other products in the collection, an external texture that gives a feeling of artistic authenticity. The dessert plate is ideal for serving cakes and pastries, but it can also be used for appetizers;: it can be combined with the other products in the collection for a classic but impressive mise en place. The dessert plate is microwave safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51me9u4G+dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bormioli Rocco","source_asin":"B07D4XKLLJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D4XKLLJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D4XKLLJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1099770,"name":"Alfi Juwel 1-Liter Carafe, Aluminum Satin Finish with Chrome Plated Trim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41T35JH44WL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Alfi's Juwel is an exceptional example of the combination of finest tableware and modern design. The elegant surface finish of this vacuum jug is captivating and Alfi's double-walled vacuum glass liner will keep liquids hot or cold for up to 13 hours. This aluminum satin finish carafe features a chrome plated metal handle and hinged cover with stopper. Juwel was originally crafted in 1918 for the Pullman cars of the American railroads and this vacuum jug has adorned the coffee tables of entire generations. Hand wash with warm soapy water. 1-liter or 8-cup capacity. From the Manufacturer The world leader in high-quality thermal carafes, Alfi designs and produces products with aesthetic appeal and superior performance. Employing cutting-edge technology, state-of-the art materials, and the craftsmanship of world-renowned designers, Alfi elevates the common carafe to a work of scientific and artistic excellence. In addition, only environmental-friendly technical equipment is used in the manufacture of Alfi products. The Juwel Carafe, a well-loved classic, celebrated its 85th anniversary in 2003. Originally designed in 1918 for the Pullman cars of American railroads, this vacuum jug has adorned the coffee tables of generations. Alfi remained true to the original form, minus a few subtle contemporary adaptations. The Juwel Carafe features the AlfiDur vacuum hard glass liner, a metal handle, and a hinged cover with stopper. The double-walled AlfiDur vacuum hard glass liner keeps hot drinks hot and cold drinks cold. Before assembly each glass liner undergoes an operational test. Other outstanding features include: The hinged lid provides single-hand operation and is food safe. The hinged lid provides single-hand operation and is food safe. The twin-walled AlfiDur toughened hard glass liner creates a vacuum between the walls, allowing neither heat nor cold to escape; 100-percent performance tested. The twin-walled AlfiDur toughened hard glass liner creates a vacuum between the walls, allowing neither heat nor cold to escape; 100-percent performance tested. The seal prevents the escape of radiant heat. The seal prevents the escape of radiant heat. The body of the flask is comprised of high-quality raw materials e.g. copper and brass. Top quality is achieved by hand craftsmanship. The body of the flask is comprised of high-quality raw materials e.g. copper and brass. Top quality is achieved by hand craftsmanship. The seals/screw fittings are food-safe and quality-tested. Each part can be replaced or repaired. The seals/screw fittings are food-safe and quality-tested. Each part can be replaced or repaired.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41T35JH44WL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alfi","source_asin":"B000IAIXJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000IAIXJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000IAIXJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
