window.products.push({"id":1099807,"name":"Spode Christmas Tree Ornament, Gift Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pQItYqB1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Loved for its nostalgia and warm Recollections of Christmases past, Spode Christmas tree is one of the world's best known holiday designs since its introduction in 1938. Each holiday season sees wonderful new introductions for collectors both old and new. Spode Christmas tree ornaments add a distinctive charm to every tree and home. These fun and charming ornaments are great for holiday decorating throughout the house, or as a special holiday gift. Each piece comes beautifully gift boxed. There is no better holiday tradition than the gift of Spode Christmas tree. This ceramic gift box ornament features multi colored kaleidoscope lighting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pQItYqB1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spode","source_asin":"B01HS55OPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HS55OPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HS55OPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1099808,"name":"Cristal de Paris Yvan Color Cristal Wine Glasses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TNjrisRGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautiful crystal glasses 24-Percent minimum lead. Completely hand cut Cased crystal is made out of two layers of crystal melted together - a colored layer of crystal on the outside and a clear layer on the inside. The outer colored layer is then cut away to reveal the clear layer underneath. Note that color is added to molten crystal and is then blown. This is the traditional and highest quality way of making crystal colorful. Due to this two-layer technique, each piece is blown twice making it significantly more valuable than similar clear crystal. Many producers do take short cuts by simply painting their clear crystal. This process gives the pieces a tendency to scratch and fade over time and ruin their value. Cased crystal consistently appreciates in value, is always collectible and is becoming more rare as companies turn to cheaper surface painting. Color: red, amber, purple, dark blue, light green, dark purple. Satin interior gift box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TNjrisRGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CRISTAL DE PARIS","source_asin":"B0085PB7OA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0085PB7OA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0085PB7OA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
