window.products.push({"id":1099821,"name":"TINVOO Vacuum Sealer Machine, Handheld Machine included 10pcs Air Sealing Zipper Bags USB Rechargeable Portable Cordless Kitchen Appliances for Food S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GFTqEQCUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Get annoyed with your huge and space occupied vacuum sealer machine? Now TINVOO automatic cordless handheld vacuum machine gives a perfect solution! With only 8.5 x 2.08 inch mini size, it’s very compact to use and smart to storage. 1.Keeps Food Fresh Strong suction power. One touch operation vacuums airtight 2.Convenient & Compact Design Easily fits in a drawer or cabinet，not only use at home, you can take it anywhere. 3.Simple and Quick Instantly store the leftovers in a vacuum sealed storage in the refrigerator. Features: 1.Protect against freezer burn, spoilage and odor 2.Prevent silver and jewelry from tarnishing 3.Wrap cosmetics for travel to protect against spills 4.Reseal open bags of potato chips and other foods in office 5.Protect cherished photos and valuable documents 6.Save money by buying in bulk and prepackaging individual servings 7.Keep charts, maps and matches safe and dry when boating or cam How to Use: 1. Fill the bag and lock the zipper, use the sealing clips for better result. (The stuff should not exceed the air suction hole on the bags.) 2. Place the bag on flat place.) 3. Make sure the exhausting part of the machine is directed at the bag’s air suction hole.) 4. Press the start button then indicator light turns on, and vacuum machine starts working. When finished, the machine stops and indicator light turns off.) 5. To prolong sealing time, please press the blue part of the air suction hole lightly with finger.) Tips: - Bags are safe and reusable for food storage. Please clean it up with dish soap, warm water and store it in a clean and dry place after using. - You can use the handy vacuum sealer with the USB cable connected to the power. This is the best way to keep the machine with longer lifetime and the vacuum pressure will be higher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GFTqEQCUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"tinvoo","source_asin":"B07DWQFRB7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1099821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DWQFRB7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DWQFRB7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
